<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-045" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-045-appraisal" source-id="s-nanqishu-045-appraisal-ws2273185">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　史臣曰：太祖膺期御世，二昆夙殞，慶命傍流，追序蕃胙。安陸王緬以宗子戚屬，弱年進仕，典郡臨州，去有餘迹，遺愛在民。蓋因情而可感，學以從政，夫豈必然。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-appraisal:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　贊曰：太祖二昆，追樹雙蕃。元託繼胤，貞興子孫。竝用威福，自取亡存。安陸稱美，事表西魂。</p>
</text>
